WEBVTT

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:39.724
Men, you must crush them!

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:41.851
This is a revolution!

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:47.691
All right!

00:01:47.691 --> 00:01:48.817
Let's go!

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.485
Let's do this!

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:51.486
Yeah!

00:01:54.030 --> 00:02:00.036
"The Start of a Revolution"

00:02:00.036 --> 00:02:02.372
4,324!

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:04.916
4,325!

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:07.377
4,326!

00:02:07.377 --> 00:02:09.754
4,327!

00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:12.007
--4,328!

00:02:12.007 --> 00:02:12.549
--Once you reach 5000,
switch your grip and do 5000 more!
--4,328!

00:02:12.549 --> 00:02:15.051
Once you reach 5000,
switch your grip and do 5000 more!
--4,329!

00:02:15.051 --> 00:02:17.512
--Do three sets of that!
--4,330!

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:20.098
4,331!

00:02:20.098 --> 00:02:22.475
4,332!

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:25.020
4,333!

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.399
Rally as hard as you can!

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:30.525
Five hundred times!

00:02:34.029 --> 00:02:36.281
Don't stop for even a second!

00:02:36.614 --> 00:02:38.658
I don't want to hear about limits!

00:02:39.617 --> 00:02:43.038
Those guys over at the main
court get better every day!

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:45.206
If you want to beat them,

00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:46.958
you'll have to improve faster than them!

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:53.256
You have to exceed your limits!

00:02:55.258 --> 00:02:57.010
This is how it's done!

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:02.891
Game and match, Oni.

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:04.601
Six games to love.

00:03:06.102 --> 00:03:07.437
He's amazing.

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:11.274
He didn't even give up a single point.

00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:14.444
And he never used his special move.

00:03:17.322 --> 00:03:21.034
Just like Irie, Oni's a lot better

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:23.370
than his court number suggests.

00:03:25.455 --> 00:03:27.374
This is getting interesting.

00:03:28.249 --> 00:03:31.169
With the score at three to two
and one abandoned match,

00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:33.963
the winner of the team
shuffle is Court 5.

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:41.888
Kanata.

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:50.230
Oh? I thought you
couldn't lift your arm.

00:03:50.605 --> 00:03:54.109
Shu-<i>san</i>, you should stay out
of other people's business.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.987
It'll come back to bite you.

00:03:59.114 --> 00:04:03.993
Understanding the emotions of
others is a gift and a curse.

00:04:05.328 --> 00:04:10.291
I lost to that Atobe guy's passion.

00:04:11.668 --> 00:04:12.669
Kanata...

00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:20.301
Besides, don't you want to
see how they'll turn out?

00:04:23.722 --> 00:04:29.227
Guess this makes Court 2 our
next team shuffle opponent.

00:04:29.227 --> 00:04:32.355
Court 2? Don't dream so small.

00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:34.024
Aim for...

00:04:36.192 --> 00:04:38.528
the court of kings, Court 1.

00:04:48.455 --> 00:04:52.751
Naturally, the former Court 5
and current Court 3 will win.

00:04:52.751 --> 00:04:53.960
Isn't that right?

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.045
Huh?

00:04:55.045 --> 00:04:57.464
<i>I'll </i>be the winner.

00:04:57.464 --> 00:05:00.425
What? That's not what you said before.

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:04.888
That's Atobe-<i>kun </i>for you.

00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:07.390
Boys!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:10.226
We don't have time to chat.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.146
We've got to talk about those games.

00:05:13.605 --> 00:05:15.523
After that, get right back to training.

00:05:15.523 --> 00:05:16.691
Quickly!

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:17.734
Right!

00:05:19.027 --> 00:05:21.863
The gatekeeper's finally
opened the gates.

00:05:22.489 --> 00:05:26.785
This training camp has never
seen such chaos before.

00:05:31.081 --> 00:05:32.248
Well, then.

00:05:34.542 --> 00:05:37.420
I wonder when the other gate will open.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:58.900
Are you sure?

00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:02.195
Of course. Don't hold back.

00:06:03.405 --> 00:06:04.823
Hadokyu!

00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:06.616
Viking Horn!

00:06:14.124 --> 00:06:14.708
Sanada!

00:06:15.417 --> 00:06:17.752
Keep going!

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:29.431
Sanada.

00:06:30.348 --> 00:06:32.642
This was a bad idea.

00:06:34.185 --> 00:06:35.562
You must be going soft.

00:06:39.024 --> 00:06:40.191
Bring it on!

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:06.217
Probability of returning three
balls without falling over...

00:07:06.217 --> 00:07:09.471
Currently 33.14%.

00:07:09.471 --> 00:07:12.432
33.12%.

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:15.310
You underestimate me, Professor.

00:07:15.643 --> 00:07:19.230
Overestimating your abilities
will only hold you back, Doctor.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.739
458!

00:07:32.827 --> 00:07:35.205
Get up, Matsudaira!

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:38.124
All the middle schoolers have

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:40.877
already finished this
part of the training!

00:07:40.877 --> 00:07:43.630
Are you a loser?

00:07:44.381 --> 00:07:48.051
You're not finished yet, are you?

00:07:49.719 --> 00:07:51.930
Of course not!

00:07:52.389 --> 00:07:53.807
One!

00:08:08.363 --> 00:08:09.406
Ready for more?

00:08:21.626 --> 00:08:22.752
One more!

00:08:38.393 --> 00:08:40.270
That's no good, Koshimae.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:44.190
You're fine up to seven,
but you can't get that eighth ball.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:47.485
You're still stuck at six.

00:08:48.153 --> 00:08:50.155
And I can't stand it!

00:08:50.488 --> 00:08:51.364
One more time.

00:08:51.364 --> 00:08:53.658
No, it's my turn.

00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:55.744
No, it's mine.

00:08:55.744 --> 00:08:58.496
What're you talking about?
Let your junior go first!

00:08:58.496 --> 00:09:00.248
You should let your seniors go first.

00:09:00.665 --> 00:09:03.084
You're no fair, Caterpillar.

00:09:03.084 --> 00:09:04.419
Who're you calling Caterpillar?

00:09:04.836 --> 00:09:07.839
Kintaro, it's Viper.

00:09:09.049 --> 00:09:11.634
I still have a long way to go.

00:09:41.498 --> 00:09:46.628
599, 600, 601...

00:09:47.379 --> 00:09:53.051
643, 644, 645...

00:09:53.426 --> 00:10:03.311
646, 647, 648, 649, 650...

00:10:04.187 --> 00:10:07.774
The high schoolers sacrifice sleep

00:10:07.774 --> 00:10:09.984
to stay out here and practice every night.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.154
Some of them are improving
quite drastically.

00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:15.031
If we underestimate them,

00:10:15.031 --> 00:10:18.410
they may leave this mountain before us.

00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:21.246
--658...
--Really? Sounds interesting.

00:10:21.246 --> 00:10:23.289
--659...
--Really? Sounds interesting.

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:27.168
--660, 661...
--But I'll definitely leave before them.

00:10:27.585 --> 00:10:36.011
662, 663, 664, 665...

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:44.269
He said he'd add something new
to our training regimen today.

00:10:44.269 --> 00:10:46.855
Nothing could surprise us now.

00:10:47.647 --> 00:10:49.733
Is everyone here?

00:10:51.526 --> 00:10:56.698
You're gonna climb the
rock face on the signal.

00:10:56.698 --> 00:11:00.994
After twenty seconds,
he's gonna drop a ball.

00:11:01.327 --> 00:11:04.414
"He?" Who are you talking about?

00:11:15.467 --> 00:11:18.511
Hit the ball before it
touches the ground.

00:11:20.013 --> 00:11:22.974
High schoolers or middle schoolers,

00:11:22.974 --> 00:11:25.810
I'll reward whichever
group can hit it first.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.228
A reward?

00:11:27.228 --> 00:11:29.230
Are you gonna give us takoyaki?

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.149
Go!

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:35.570
Leave this to me!

00:11:43.703 --> 00:11:46.664
Damn it. This is impossible to climb.

00:11:57.175 --> 00:11:59.803
We're not even halfway up.

00:12:00.345 --> 00:12:01.888
You failed.

00:12:02.514 --> 00:12:05.767
We'll do this once every morning,
afternoon, and night.

00:12:05.767 --> 00:12:06.685
Got it?

00:12:09.979 --> 00:12:11.314
Sounds fun.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.607
You won't beat me!

00:13:38.902 --> 00:13:40.028
You bastard.

00:14:03.843 --> 00:14:06.304
Victory is ours!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.848
All right!

00:14:08.848 --> 00:14:10.225
Yeah!

00:14:14.479 --> 00:14:15.689
We did it!

00:14:15.689 --> 00:14:18.274
I'm the one who hit it...

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.412
Everyone line up.

00:14:30.704 --> 00:14:32.372
Line up?

00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:34.207
I'm at the front.

00:14:34.207 --> 00:14:36.501
I want my reward first.

00:14:39.379 --> 00:14:44.050
Run, single file, as fast
as you can down this path.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:46.761
Don't stop for any reason.

00:14:46.761 --> 00:14:48.263
Run?

00:14:48.263 --> 00:14:51.975
While you run,
balls will come flying at you.

00:14:51.975 --> 00:14:54.728
The man in front has to return them.

00:14:54.728 --> 00:14:56.771
You mean me?

00:14:56.771 --> 00:14:59.566
Once you hit a ball, go to the back

00:14:59.566 --> 00:15:02.068
of the line and change leaders.

00:15:03.486 --> 00:15:07.866
If any one of you stops
or fails to hit a ball,

00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:09.951
come back here and start over.

00:15:09.951 --> 00:15:11.036
Got it?

00:15:11.327 --> 00:15:15.874
Hold on. This is our reward?

00:15:15.874 --> 00:15:18.335
Are you serious? Where's my takoyaki?

00:15:18.668 --> 00:15:22.756
Quit complaining! Just shut up and run!

00:15:23.923 --> 00:15:28.178
All we have to do is return all the
balls and keep running, right?

00:15:28.553 --> 00:15:29.971
On your mark.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.475
Hey.

00:15:39.773 --> 00:15:44.486
If you somehow make
it through in one go,

00:15:44.486 --> 00:15:46.488
don't come back.

00:15:46.821 --> 00:15:48.907
Just keep running forward.

00:15:48.907 --> 00:15:51.368
Don't come back? What do you...

00:15:51.701 --> 00:15:55.372
Time to go! Run!

00:15:55.872 --> 00:15:57.457
Let's go!

00:16:01.544 --> 00:16:05.340
Show me what you brats can do.

00:16:10.428 --> 00:16:13.431
What's that bearded old man thinking?

00:16:14.224 --> 00:16:19.145
Does anyone know where this path leads?

00:16:19.145 --> 00:16:21.398
I have no idea.

00:16:22.273 --> 00:16:26.611
Are we gonna keep sprinting
for tens of kilometers?

00:16:26.611 --> 00:16:29.280
It might only be one kilometer.

00:16:29.781 --> 00:16:35.203
Probability of that coach giving
us such a short path: 0%.

00:16:35.203 --> 00:16:36.788
Here it comes!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.667
Koshimae, your turn!

00:16:40.667 --> 00:16:42.043
Okay!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.006
Momo-<i>senpai</i>, you're up!

00:16:46.339 --> 00:16:47.424
Got it!

00:16:47.799 --> 00:16:49.509
Don't screw this up!

00:16:49.509 --> 00:16:52.387
If you do, we'll have to start over!

00:16:53.096 --> 00:16:55.390
Right back at you!

00:16:59.936 --> 00:17:01.438
There you go!

00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:04.566
Burning!

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.118
Number two!

00:17:15.827 --> 00:17:17.495
I could keep going forever!

00:17:28.798 --> 00:17:31.843
These balls have a lot of power.

00:17:34.804 --> 00:17:39.184
My ball had a lot of force as well.

00:17:39.184 --> 00:17:41.853
I'm getting excited.

00:17:57.202 --> 00:17:58.578
Not bad.

00:17:59.662 --> 00:18:01.081
The path ends up ahead!

00:18:01.081 --> 00:18:02.957
We're almost there, guys!

00:18:07.796 --> 00:18:08.838
Eight balls!

00:18:09.422 --> 00:18:12.759
Oh, crap! Koshimae can't
hit eight balls yet!

00:18:13.718 --> 00:18:16.221
Echizen! Focus!

00:18:16.221 --> 00:18:17.972
You can do it, Echizen!

00:18:17.972 --> 00:18:19.182
Echizen!

00:18:19.182 --> 00:18:20.642
Get them!

00:18:20.642 --> 00:18:23.019
Echizen!

00:18:37.283 --> 00:18:39.369
Hit it!

00:18:46.292 --> 00:18:49.546
Probability of Echizen
returning the eighth ball...

00:18:50.338 --> 00:18:51.923
100%.

00:19:01.016 --> 00:19:05.353
Looks like... we made it.

00:19:06.563 --> 00:19:08.606
Th-That was easy.

00:19:09.315 --> 00:19:11.985
I could've... kept going.

00:19:11.985 --> 00:19:14.779
I could've kept running.

00:19:16.114 --> 00:19:20.702
All of those balls were tough.

00:19:20.952 --> 00:19:23.788
Who was hitting them?

00:19:25.206 --> 00:19:27.083
Look, guys.

00:19:32.255 --> 00:19:35.258
They hit all those balls?

00:19:35.258 --> 00:19:38.928
Were they testing the
results of our training?

00:19:39.721 --> 00:19:42.432
Ultimately, yes. But...

00:19:43.058 --> 00:19:48.271
If not for them, we would
never have trained so hard.

00:19:51.816 --> 00:19:54.277
Don't come back!

00:19:54.986 --> 00:19:57.238
Just run forward.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:04.746
Let's go.

00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:10.710
How pathetic.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.880
You were nothing more than a stepping
stone for the middle schoolers.

00:20:14.297 --> 00:20:18.051
We're not done yet.

00:20:18.635 --> 00:20:21.304
Let's start today's training.

00:20:23.139 --> 00:20:25.308
I don't have that kind of time.

00:20:25.308 --> 00:20:28.603
We'll bring you all the
sake you can drink.

00:20:36.361 --> 00:20:38.363
What is that shack?

00:20:38.905 --> 00:20:41.658
There's a picture on the wall.

00:20:43.785 --> 00:20:47.247
Three boats... It's "Mifune."

00:20:47.789 --> 00:20:49.416
A pun?

00:20:49.416 --> 00:20:50.917
Super lame.

00:20:51.376 --> 00:20:54.421
It's locked.

00:20:56.548 --> 00:20:58.591
Where'd you get that key?

00:20:59.092 --> 00:21:01.344
Coach Mifune gave it to me.

00:21:10.395 --> 00:21:13.314
Is this our reward?

00:21:23.658 --> 00:21:24.951
Who the hell are you?

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:28.830
You guys are from Court 2, aren't you?

00:21:29.914 --> 00:21:31.458
What about it?

00:21:33.043 --> 00:21:34.002
Hey...

00:21:35.712 --> 00:21:38.048
Why don't we play a match?

00:23:17.063 --> 00:23:18.982
"Preview"

00:23:18.982 --> 00:23:20.567
"Preview"
Looks like you made it out of
hell alive, Ryoma Echizen.

00:23:20.567 --> 00:23:22.569
Looks like you made it out of
hell alive, Ryoma Echizen.

00:23:22.569 --> 00:23:24.529
It was pretty fun for hell.

00:23:24.529 --> 00:23:26.740
Not that it was hard.

00:23:27.032 --> 00:23:28.825
How much have you improved?

00:23:28.825 --> 00:23:32.203
Why don't you see for yourself?

00:23:32.203 --> 00:23:34.831
You're as impudent as always.

00:23:34.831 --> 00:23:36.166
But my interest is piqued.

00:23:36.166 --> 00:23:38.793
Then it's time for me to get my revenge.

00:23:42.172 --> 00:23:44.257
"Towards Your New Brilliant Selves"
The next episode of <i>Prince of Tennis II </i>is:
"Towards Your New Brilliant Selves."

00:23:44.257 --> 00:23:47.136
"Towards Your New Brilliant Selves"
I will climb even higher.
Towards Your New Brilliant Selves
